web/config.js
# macOS
.DS_Store
# Deployment facts (contains account IDs and ARNs; never commit)
docs/deployment-facts.md
# Backend Lambda build artifacts (regenerated from source; never commit)
deploy/backend/*.zip
# Packaged component hand-off artifact (regenerated on demand; never commit)
kb-integration-agent.zip
